html:
{%- macro v(value) -%}{{ (value or "") | e }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro day(value) -%}{{ frappe.utils.format_date(value) if value else "" }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro who(user) -%}{{ v(frappe.db.get_value("User", user, "full_name") if user else "") }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- set logo = frappe.db.get_single_value("HRMS Addon Branding", "company_logo") -%}
{%- set employee = frappe.get_doc("Employee", doc.employee) -%}
<style>
.lpl-letter { font-family: Cambria, Georgia, serif; font-size: 12.5px; color: #000; line-height: 1.55; }
.lpl-letter p { margin: 0 0 12px; }
.lpl-letter .addr { font-weight: bold; margin: 0; }
.lpl-letter h4 { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; margin: 14px 0 6px; }
.lpl-letter .logo { text-align: right; margin: 0 0 18px; }
.lpl-letter .sign-off { margin: 30px 0 0; }
.lpl-letter .who { font-weight: bold; margin: 0; }
.lpl-letter .ack { margin-top: 22px; }
</style>
<div class="lpl-letter">
{% if logo %}<p class="logo"><img src="{{ logo }}" style="max-height:64px"></p>{% endif %}
<p class="addr">{{ day(doc.date) }}</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p class="addr">{{ v(employee.salutation) }} {{ v(doc.employee_name) }}</p>
<p class="addr">{{ v(doc.employee_number or doc.employee) }}</p>
<p class="addr">Division &ndash; {{ v(doc.department) }}</p>
<p class="addr">Plant, {{ v(doc.branch) }}</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><b>Dear {{ v(employee.first_name or doc.employee_name) }},</b></p>
<h4>RE: SUSPENSION FROM DUTY</h4>
<p>Please refer to your recent case of <b>{{ v(doc.nature_of_offence) }}</b> among many other disciplinary cases.
This level of unseriousness is unacceptable and therefore, Management has decided to suspend you for
<b>{{ doc.days }}</b> days {{ "without pay" if doc.without_pay else "with pay" }} starting from
<b>{{ day(doc.from_date) }}</b> to <b>{{ day(doc.to_date) }}</b>.</p>
<p><b>Note:</b> Any repeat of your performance inconsistences in more severe disciplinary action in future and or
termination of your services.</p>
<p>You will report back to the Human Resource Office on <b>{{ day(doc.report_back_on) }}</b> to resume your
duties.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><b>For, Ms. {{ v(doc.company) }}</b></p>
<div class="sign-off">
<p>&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;</p>
<p class="who">{{ who(doc.gm_by) }}</p>
<p class="who">General Manager</p>
</div>
<p class="ack">I acknowledge the above disciplinary procedure,</p>
<p>Name&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;
Sign: &hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;Date: &hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;</p>
<p>Witness, HRM {% if doc.hrm_by %}<b>{{ who(doc.hrm_by) }}</b>{% else %}&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;{% endif %}
Date: &hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;</p>
</div>
